  </header>
  <div aria-label="PowerShell 정적 프롬프트" data-part="terminal-windows-console"><pre data-part="terminal-windows-output"><code><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--prompt">PS C:\Users\klic-design&gt; Get-Location</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output"></span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output">Path</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output">----</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output">C:\Users\klic-design</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output"></span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--prompt">PS C:\Users\klic-design&gt; Get-ChildItem</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output">Mode   LastWriteTime   Length Name</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output">d----  11/03/2026                Projects</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output">-a---  11/03/2026       1248      README.md</span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--output"></span><span data-part="terminal-windows-line terminal-windows-line--current">PS C:\Users\klic-design&gt;<span aria-hidden="true" data-part="terminal-windows-cursor"></span></span></code></pre></div>
